      "statement": "The dispatch contract defaults to multitask_strategy='interrupt' (a follow-up halts and resumes the active run with full history plus the new message), durability='sync' checkpointing before each step, a completion webhook, and stream_resumable plus the Protocol v3 run shape so the dashboard can attach to and observe runs it did not itself start.",
